(:id "union-field-arms/rust/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "the direct text and direct array arm clauses are unproved: this backend's unionRowable (internal/codegen/rusttable/cook.go:391) refuses a direct text or array arm payload and drops the whole fixed form silently (only build_version.rs, no <base>_fixed.rs), so no writer or reader exists for the layout the node's :remaining asks for (\"Implement direct text/byte-buffer/array arm layout and emitters\"), while the shared fixed-form gate ir.TableFixedSupported (ir/fixedform.go:241) admits them; only the named-type-payload shape is proved, at internal/codegen/rusttable/fixedroadmap_t10_test.go:TestFixedRoadmapRustT10CompositesOptionals/union-arrays/rust/valid-data")
(:id "payload-free-arms/rust/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "the [capability] clause \"the leg writes and reads the construct with non-default and boundary values, asserted, in a target a gate runs\" is unproved: GenerateLineage emits no fixed form for a table closure holding a payload-free arm (only build_version.rs, no <base>_fixed.rs, no fixed_runtime.rs), so there is no writer or reader to exercise; the shared eligibility rule ir.TableFixedSupported admits the nil arm (ir/fixedform.go) but this backend's fixed emission still skips the whole root")
